
# New AppleNew List by Claude 
# AppleNews 服务策略 (remote AppleNews.list removed; everything it contributed is now explicit here, in the same position)
# >Apple News must precede the broader Apple rule sets below.
# --- Process (macOS) ---
PROCESS-NAME,News,AppleNews
# --- App identification by User-Agent (HTTP only; also catches geod/locationd) ---
USER-AGENT,com.apple.geod*,AppleNews
USER-AGENT,com.apple.Maps,AppleNews
USER-AGENT,geod*,AppleNews
USER-AGENT,locationd*,AppleNews
USER-AGENT,Maps*,AppleNews
USER-AGENT,News*,AppleNews
USER-AGENT,AppleNews*,AppleNews
USER-AGENT,com.apple.news*,AppleNews
# --- News hosts (suffix rules already cover their exact-domain twins) ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.news,AppleNews
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,news.apple.com,AppleNews
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,news-client.apple.com,AppleNews
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,news-client-search.apple.com,AppleNews
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,news-events.apple.com,AppleNews
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,news-edge.apple.com,AppleNews
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,news-assets.apple.com,AppleNews
DOMAIN,news-todayconfig-edge.apple.com,AppleNews
DOMAIN,news-sports-events.apple.com,AppleNews
DOMAIN,c.apple.com,AppleNews
# --- Region detection / location (gspe1-ssl.ls.apple.com is covered by the ls.apple.com suffix) ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gs-loc.apple.com,AppleNews
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gs-loc-cn.apple.com,AppleNews
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,lcdn-locator.apple.com,AppleNews
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,lcdn-registration.apple.com,AppleNews
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ls.apple.com,AppleNews
# --- BROAD shared Apple domains (the 7 entries the old list uniquely contributed), kept to preserve existing routing ---
# >They also cover: gateway.icloud.com + mask*.icloud.com (icloud.com),
# >apple.comscoreresearch.com (comscoreresearch.com), apps.mzstatic.com (mzstatic.com).
# >If you ever narrow them, re-add for News: DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gateway.icloud.com / DOMAIN,apple.comscoreresearch.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,comscoreresearch.com,AppleNews
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mzstatic.com,AppleNews
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aaplimg.com,AppleNews
# V6: play/bag kept on AppleNews for News; the rest of itunes.apple.com (App Store, iBooks, Music) moved to Apple group
DOMAIN,play.itunes.apple.com,AppleNews
DOMAIN,bag.itunes.apple.com,AppleNews
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,configuration.apple.com,AppleNews
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,icloud.com,AppleNews
DOMAIN,play-cdn.itunes-apple.com.akadns.net,AppleNews

